:5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"471"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T08:16:15-08:00","id":384239,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NeoTiamat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/241240-my-co-pcs-can-t-be-this-psycho?p=384227#post384227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Roll 20? *not familiar with this*</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"http://roll20.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Roll20.</a> I've never used it myself but it's popular among online gamers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T08:17:16-08:00","id":384240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Roll 20? *not familiar with this* </div> </div> </div>It's online application that can be used to host any RP campaign, not only those that use 1d20 die. It has in-built dice roller, voicechat and videochat options for those with not sucky connection (we cannot afford it, so it's all in text), option to keep notes, maps and other useful tools for a Gamemaster. When my Pathfinder GM was running a heist he had whole layout of building displayed along with tokens that represented our PCs and NPCs.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://roll20.net\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://roll20.net/images/roll20-home-og.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://roll20.net\" target=\"_blank\"> Roll20 - Virtual Tabletop for Playing D&amp;D, Pathfinder, Call of Cthulhu, TTRPGs </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://roll20.net\" target=\"_blank\"> http://roll20.net </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Easily create characters, organize games, purchase content, find players, and customize your story for your group - all in your browser. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It's free of charge, probably there are some extra features if you subscribe and pay, but basic features are more than enough to host a game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}